{"id":"a58de3409bb13c72","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-prop-finite-support.md","title":"Finite Support","display":"prop-finite-support — Finite Support","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-finite-support","aliases":["58-prop-finite-support"],"display":"prop-finite-support — Finite Support","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-finite-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-finite-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-finite-support — Finite Support"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"15b258e6284e3da4\" href=\"?note=15b258e6284e3da4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration\">58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\gamma,p,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}},P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma,1_\\gamma\\in V\">\\(M,\\gamma,p,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}},P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma,1_\\gamma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteSupportIteration}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteSupportIteration}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteSupportIteration}_S(M,\\gamma,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}})\\land\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\gamma)=\\langle P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma,1_\\gamma\\rangle\\land p\\in P_\\gamma\\to\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\gamma\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(p)|&lt;\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteSupportIteration}_S(M,\\gamma,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}})\\land\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\gamma)=\\langle P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma,1_\\gamma\\rangle\\land p\\in P_\\gamma\\to\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\gamma\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(p)|&lt;\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In the canonical partial-function presentation of a finite-support iteration, the domain of a condition is its support; hence every condition has finite domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"15b258e6284e3da4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-finite-support-iteration]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\gamma,p,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}},P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma,1_\\gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteSupportIteration}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteSupportIteration}_S(M,\\gamma,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\dot{\\mathbb Q}})\\land\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\gamma)=\\langle P_\\gamma,\\leq_\\gamma,1_\\gamma\\rangle\\land p\\in P_\\gamma\\to\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\gamma\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(p)|<\\omega","display":true}],"bytes":957,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3959","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-prop-finite-support.md|58-prop-finite-support]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["15b258e6284e3da4"]}